      "statement": "Brijio is a pnpm TypeScript monorepo that connects remote AI agents to the browser session a user already controls through an explicit Agent -> MCP Server -> WebSocket Relay -> Browser Extension -> Browser Session request/response chain, without launching a separate browser, cloning sessions, exporting cookies, or streaming screenshots.",
